Id: svc001w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_services
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST CM-7; ISO 8.21; CE Secure configuration

SMF runs a service that speaks cleartext or trusts the
network (telnet, ftp, finger, rlogin, rsh): anyone
listening owns the logins. Turn it off (svcadm disable),
or remove it.
